; complex TRAP: customers with at least one 'open' order (semi-join). customers has no key: de-duplicate by customer ROW (left position), not by c_id (S8). Upper-cased name label built for all customers before the join; sorted by name then id
LOAD   ci, customers.c_id
LOAD   cn, customers.c_name
LOAD   cr, customers.c_region
UPPER  un, cn
LEFT   lab, un, 5
LOAD   oc, orders.o_cust
LOAD   os, orders.o_status
HJOIN  li, ri, ci, oc
GATHER js, os, ri
EQ     m, js, 'open'
IDX    i, m
GATHER lp, li, i
SORT   s, lp ASC NF
GATHER sp, lp, s
GROUP  g, sp
GFIRST f, g
GATHER pos, sp, f
GATHER r1, ci, pos
GATHER r2, cn, pos
GATHER r3, lab, pos
GATHER r4, cr, pos
SORT   t, r2 ASC NL, r1 ASC NL
GATHER o1, r1, t
GATHER o2, r2, t
GATHER o3, r3, t
GATHER o4, r4, t
OUT    o1, o2, o3, o4
